      "id": "claim_a8f8d3e7404e4bce8f190e44f801e184",
      "statement": "Celery app configuration is lazy: _load_config runs on first access to app.conf, applies the registered config source, runs detect_settings, drains pending defaults and periodic tasks, and sends on_after_configure; an already-referenced Settings object is swapped in place.",
