        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ffc76284d8a044fa823b89cca956c4f9",
      "statement": "App.finalize runs once under a mutex: it announces the app to global finalizers, evaluates pending task proxies, rebinds registered tasks and sends on_after_finalize; with autofinalize disabled, using tasks before finalize raises a contract-breach RuntimeError.",
